<title>POLAND: Polish wood firm Paged to enter bourse Oct 10.</title>
<headline>Polish wood firm Paged to enter bourse Oct 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The management of the Warsaw bourse decided that the Polish wood and furniture trader Paged SA would enter the bourse on October 10, Paged said in a statement.</p>
<p>Paged's shares will be traded on the main market of the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
